            0.144
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• We then multiplied the result by the numerator of the multiplier, that is 2, to get "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "{ \\frac { 6 } { 5 } } ."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Multiplier Multiplicand"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.146,
            0.523,
            0.203
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Thus, whenever we need to multiply a fraction and a whole number, we follow the steps above."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.21,
            0.524,
            0.288
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example 1:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " A farmer had 5 grandchildren. She distributed "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 2 } { 3 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " acre of land to each of her grandchildren."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.528,
            0.116,
            0.839,
            0.263
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 4,
              "bbox": [
                0.528,
                0.116,
                0.839,
                0.263
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_3_image_4.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.295,
            0.714,
            0.316
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "How much land in all did she give to her grandchildren?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.359,
            0.321,
            0.638,
            0.359
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_3_equation_6.jpg",
          "content": "5 \\times \\frac{2}{3} = \\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{2}{3} = \\frac{10}{3}."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.376,
            0.847,
            0.427
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "? "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example 2:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 1 hour of internet time costs ₹8. How much will 1 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{1}{4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " hours of internet time cost?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.44,
            0.704,
            0.475
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 4 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " hours is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 5 } { 4 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " hours (converting from a mixed fraction)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.477,
            0.536,
            0.596
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Cost of "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 5 } { 4 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " hour of internet time "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\begin{aligned}&=\\frac{5}{4} \\times 8 \\\\&= 5 \\times \\frac{8}{4} \\\\&= 5 \\times 2 \\\\&= 10.\\end{aligned}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.602,
            0.564,
            0.635
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "It costs ₹10 for "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 { \\frac { 1 } { 4 } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " hours of internet time."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.641,
            0.293,
            0.665
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Figure it Out"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.672,
            0.848,
            0.746
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. Tenzin drinks "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " glass of milk every day. How many glasses of milk does he drink in a week? How many glasses of milk did he drink in the month of January?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.748,
            0.848,
            0.806
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. A team of workers can make 1 km of a water canal in 8 days. So, in one day, the team can make ___ km of the water canal. If they work 5 days a week, they can make ___ km of the water canal in a week."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.809,
            0.849,
            0.867
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. Manju and two of her neighbours buy 5 litres of oil every week and share it equally among the 3 families. How much oil does each family get in a week? How much oil will one family get in 4 weeks?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.87,
            0.848,
            0.923
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. Safia saw the Moon setting on Monday at 10 pm. Her mother, who is a scientist, told her that every day the Moon sets "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{5}{6}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " hour later than"
            }
          ]
        },
